                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Fun but short detective game where the bulk of gameplay is typing in keywords to unlock the words needed to fill out your report on what happened.\n\nUnfortunately, you can basically put the entire story together before you even touch the computer.\nAnd that's before you even stumble across your report, where it basically spells out what happened, you just have to fill in some blanks like an ad lib.\n\nStill, the game play loop of guessing keywords to unlock new entries is fun. It's a pleasant hour of a game.",
